 "text": "Hello! How's everything today? Try recording in a quieter room, away from doors, windows, and big pieces of furniture. Recording on carpet rather than a hard floor also helps. Then move the fridge, freezer, and anything with a motor onto a tray or cart and put a mat under it. Even ten centimetres can make a difference. If you can find a spot ten metres away, even better. Ideally in a cupboard or a wardrobe, with the door closed. At worst on different floor, like an upper landing. Let me know how it goes.",
